## CHECKPOINT FORMATS

### Micro-Checkpoint (per section — Phases 1-5)
```
  ✅ 3.1: visualiserPartenaireREST — 14/14 flow steps
  ✅ 4.1: pub.visualiserPartenaire (docType) — 8/8 fields
  ✅ 5.1: visualiserPartenaire.wsdl0 — 3/3 operations
  ✅ 6.1: nodesACL — 12/12 ACL mappings
```

### Phase Checkpoint (per phase)
```
╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ ✅ PHASE {n} COMPLETE: {Phase Name}                          │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ {Summary metrics with micro-checkpoint rollup}                │
│ 💾 State saved to .webmethods-state.json                      │
│ → Proceeding automatically to Phase {n+1}...                  │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
```

**CRITICAL:** After EVERY phase checkpoint, UPDATE `.webmethods-state.json` with:
- `current_phase` incremented
- Phase status set to `"done"`
- Micro-checkpoint counts recorded in `checkpoints` array

